           \u003Cp>single line of Greek letters across the middle of the stone\u003C/p>\n                                    \u003Crs ana=\"#execution.chiselled\" ref=\"http://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/writing/lod/1\">chiselled\u003C/rs>\n                                    \u003Cdamage/>\n                                \u003C/layout>\n                            \u003C/layoutDesc>\n                        \u003C/objectDesc>\n                        \u003ChandDesc>\n                            \u003ChandNote>\n                                \u003Cp>Neatly incised letters without serfis: omicron is small and mid-line; mu has vertical first and last strokes, mid-strokes only descend halfway; nu has short diagonal and right vertical; alpha is broad with broken bar; sigma is incomplete but may have slightly open top and bottom strokes\u003C/p>\n                                \u003Cp source=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/annotator.html\">\n                                    Types list:\n                                    \u003Cref target=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Α-type2.html\">Α type2\u003C/ref>\n                                    \u003Cref target=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Μ-type3.html\">Μ type3\u003C/ref>\n                                    \u003Cref target=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Μ-type3.1.html\">Μ type3.1\u003C/ref>\n                                    \u003Cref target=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Ν-type1.html\">Ν type1\u003C/ref>\n                                    \u003Cref target=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Ν-type1.2.html\">Ν type1.2\u003C/ref>\n                                    \u003Cref target=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Ο-type1.html\">Ο type1\u003C/ref>\n                                    \u003Cref target=\"https://kingsdigitallab.github.io/crossreads/data/allographs/types/greek-Ο-type1.2.html\">Ο type1.2\u003C/ref>\n                                \u003C/p>\n                                \u003Clocus from=\"line1\" to=\"line1\">Line 1\u003C/locus>\n                                \u003Cdimensions type=\"letterHeight\">\n                                    \u003Cheight unit=\"mm\" atLeast=\"20\" atMost=\"56\">20-56\u003C/height>\n                                \u003C/dimensions>\n                                \u003Clocus from=\"line1\" to=\"line2\">Interlineation line 1 to 2\u003C/locus>\n                                \u003Cdimensions type=\"interlinear\">\n                                    \u003Cheight unit=\"mm\"/>\n                                \u003C/dimensions>\n                            \u003C/handNote>\n                        \u003C/handDesc>\n                    \u003C/physDesc>\n                    \u003Chistory>\n                        \u003Corigin>\n                            \u003CorigPlace>\u003Cregion>Sicilia\u003C/region>\n                                \u003CplaceName type=\"ancient\" ref=\"http://pleiades.stoa.org/places/462153\">Centuripae\u003C/placeName>\n                                \u003CplaceName type=\"modern\" ref=\"http://sws.geonames.org/2525032\">Centuripe\u003C/placeName>\n                                \u003Cgeo>37.62336, 14.74049\u003C/geo>\n                            \u003C/origPlace>\n                            \u003CorigDate datingMethod=\"#julian\" notBefore-custom=\"-0300\" notAfter-custom=\"-0201\" cert=\"low\" evidence=\"lettering\">3rd century ?\u003C/origDate>\n                        \u003C/origin>\n                        \u003Cprovenance type=\"found\">Original discovery not recorded.\u003C/provenance>\n                        \u003Cprovenance type=\"observed\" subtype=\"autopsied\">None\u003C/provenance>\n                        \u003Cacquisition/>